Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:07.47,middle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(202.5,420.5)}1
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:10.14,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an7\blur4}那样实在无趣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:10.14,edjp4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an7\blur4}それじゃつまらないよね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:11.08,middle,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正准圆_GBK\frz270\pos(1450,535)}乌洛波罗斯之眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.18,edcn4,,0,0,0,,{\frz270\fn@方正准圆_GBK\pos(1890,740)\fad(120,80)\blur4}要不要玩游戏 ？
